    "sections": {
        "description": "Vendix is a free, lightweight WordPress theme for Elementor, built for business, store and news sites. It draws a simple header, footer and page title only when no page builder layout is set, follows the colors and fonts of Elementor Site Settings and keeps a short list of options in the Customizer: a site type for fitting defaults, a sticky or transparent header with a button, footer widget columns and page title styles. Blog options on every site type (list, grid, classic and overlay post lists, post card items, post heads with the title above, below or over a wide image, a narrow reading column, related posts). Store options for WooCommerce (header cart, filter panel, product cards, cart and checkout styles) and news options (top bar, reserved widget areas). Page layout options on every page, full right-to-left support and Turkish and Arabic translations. Works with ARN Smart AI-Powered Site Utilities for Elementor, the free Vendix plugin on WordPress.org: the theme takes the colors of its design system, and the theme's welcome page opens its guided setup. The theme works without it too. Based on Hello Biz by the Elementor Team."
    },
